# Keep the image build context clean.
#
# A CI checkout contains none of these, so excluding them also makes a local build equivalent to
# the CI one. Shipping Windows obj/ output into a Linux build stage is the specific hazard here.
.git/
.gitignore
.github/
docs/
**/bin/
**/obj/
**/.vs/
**/.vscode/
**/*.user
**/*.suo
**/*.log
